* {{l|is|brenna við}} (to get burned)
*:{{ux|is|Maturinn '''brann við'''.|The food '''got burned'''.}}
* {{l|is|vilja brenna við}} (to tend to happen)
*: {{ux|is|Það '''vill brenna við'''.|It '''tends to happen'''.}}
* {{l|is|brenna í skinninu}} (to be [[raring]] to go)
*: {{ux|is|Hann '''brennur í skinninu'''.|He's '''raring to go'''.}}
* {{l|is|láta sér ekki allt fyrir brjósti brenna}} (to be not afraid of anything)

